{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Writes or checks ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand\/trackingPlan","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" as the command’s arguments say, and exits.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplancommand\/main()"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:13TrackingPlans0A11PlanCommandPAAE4mainyyFZ","remoteSource":{"fileName":"TrackingPlanCommand.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand.swift#L60"},"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","title":"main()","extendedModule":"TrackingPlans","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"main","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"()","kind":"text"}],"modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand\/main()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"main"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given one argument, a directory, it writes the plan there, as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does: it exits with status 0 once the plan is written, and 73 ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EX_CANTCREAT"},{"type":"text","text":") when a file"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be written."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" and a directory, it compares the plan with the one committed there, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" does, printing the check’s report when they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differ: it exits with status 0 when they match, 1 when a difference is breaking, and 2 when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the committed plan is only out of date."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check --breaking-only"},{"text":" and a directory, it compares them the same way but fails only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when a difference is breaking: it exits with status 1 then, printing the report, and 0 when","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they match or the plan there is only out of date. It prints the differences of an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out-of-date plan to standard output, as information.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Given anything else, it exits with status 64 (","type":"text"},{"code":"EX_USAGE","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"): ","type":"text"},{"code":"check","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" alone (write to ","type":"text"},{"code":".\/check","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for a directory of that name), ","type":"text"},{"code":"check --breaking-only","type":"codeVoice"},{"tex